sequenceDiagram
  participant User as Public user
  participant Starter as Tenant starter
  participant API as Pumpkin API
  participant Captcha as Turnstile
  participant Store as FormEntry store
  participant TA as TenantAdmin
  participant SA as SuperAdmin
  participant Notify as Notification service

  User->>Starter: Complete form + challenge
  Starter->>API: submissionId + correlationId + fields + token
  API->>Captcha: server verification (bounded/idempotent)
  Captcha-->>API: success/action/hostname or structured failure
  API->>Store: create-or-return existing exact-one FormEntry
  Store-->>API: FormEntry ID + duplicate/readback state
  API-->>Starter: authoritative result + requiresNewCaptcha
  TA->>API: tenant-scoped inbox/read/status/export
  SA->>API: explicit authorized tenant context
  Store-->>Notify: independent delivery work after persistence
  Notify-->>Store: delivery status only; never recreates FormEntry
